# Omniverse environment — copy to `.env`.
#
# Provider keys and endpoints are SHARED LIVE from Omni (~/.omni/agent/settings.json
# and ~/.omni/.env), exactly like OmniBots and OmniCode. Nothing needs to go here.
#
# Optional, this app only (these win over Omni):
#   OMNIVERSE_<PROVIDER>_KEY=...       e.g. OMNIVERSE_GROQ_KEY
#   OMNIVERSE_<PROVIDER>_BASE_URL=...  e.g. OMNIVERSE_REFLECTION_BASE_URL
#   OMNIVERSE_<PROVIDER>_MODEL=...     default model for avatar forging / chat
# Provider names use Omni's: nvidia agnes xkiro groq openrouter atria reflection minimax.io (MINIMAX_IO) kimi openai
#
# Without Omni installed (standalone), Omni-style names work here too:
#   OMNI_NVIDIA_KEY= OMNI_AGNES_KEY= OMNI_XKIRO_KEY= OMNI_GROQ_KEY= OMNI_OPENROUTER_KEY=
#   OMNI_ATRIA_KEY= OMNI_REFLECTION_KEY= OMNI_MINIMAX_IO_KEY=
#
# OMNIVERSE_PORT=4777
